# Files that are for people and agents working on the code, not for the public site.
# Vercel does not upload anything listed here, so these paths answer "not found".
# Folder names start with "/" so they only match at the top of the repo.
# Do NOT list package.json, vercel.json or anything under /api: the site needs them.
*.md
/.github
/.env.example
/db
/docs
/scripts
